[1.48,"o","     Read with                 Cost a year, this repo   Compared with the best option\r\n"]
[1.54,"o","  1  Jev + Vercel AI Gateway   ≈ $0.072                 the best option\r\n"]
[1.6,"o","  2  Vercel AI Gateway         ≈ $0.13                  ≈ 1 in 3 breaking-change flags wrong\r\n"]
[1.66,"o","  3  Anthropic                 ≈ $0.15                  ≈ 90% of its changes\r\n"]
[1.72,"o","  4  Not now                   free                     ≈ 27%: advisories and deprecations only\r\n"]
